<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian yr/yr inflation falls below 10 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Nigerian yr/yr inflation falls below 10 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Federal Office of Statistics announced the following consumer price inflation figures for May on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    NIGERIA INFLATION	     May 97   Apr 97    May 96</p>
<p>    CHANGE ON YEAR (percent)     +9.9    +14.2     +31.0</p>
<p>    CHANGE ON MONTH (percent)    +1.5     +0.4	+5.5</p>
<p>    INDEX (Base Sept 85 = 100) 2885.2   2843.4    2626.4</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317</p>
</text>
